      "description": "Selected camera row with the actual missing-thumbnail fallback.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-row\" aria-pressed=\"true\"><span class=\"ds-thumb\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m22 8-6 4 6 4V8Z\"/><rect x=\"2\" y=\"6\" width=\"14\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\"/></svg></span><span class=\"ds-copy\"><strong>Kannur public street view</strong><span>Kannur, Kerala, India</span><small>Live stream</small></span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-row{width:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;text-align:left;padding:11px 10px;border:0;border-radius:6px;margin-bottom:3px;background:none;color:var(--ink,#1c2832);cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 150ms,color 150ms;font-family:'DM Sans Variable',sans-serif;}.ds-row:hover{background:#f1f5fa}.ds-row[aria-pressed=true]{background:#edf3ff}.ds-row:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#326be0);outline-offset:3px}.ds-thumb{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:74px;height:57px;flex-shrink:0;background:#e6ebf0;color:#607386;overflow:hidden;border-radius:5px}.ds-copy{min-width:0;flex:1}.ds-copy strong{display:block;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.45;max-height:32px;overflow:hidden}.ds-copy span{display:block;font-size:10px;color:#596976;margin-top:3px;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}.ds-copy small{display:block;font-size:9px;color:#2454b7;margin-top:5px}"
    },
